<title>USA: Equitable Cos corrects dividend date.</title>
<headline>Equitable Cos corrects dividend date.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Cos of Iowa said Monday it was correcting the record date of its previously announced quarterly dividend to May 15.</p>
<p>In April, the company incorrectly said the record date was May 14.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable Tuesday and is $0.165 a share, unchanged from the previous quarter, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
